# Alembic Database Migrations

This directory contains the database migration environment and version scripts for DocTune Studio.

## Usage

```bash
# Run all pending migrations
alembic upgrade head

# Check current revision status
alembic current

# Generate a new migration automatically from model changes
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description_of_changes"

# Rollback one migration
alembic downgrade -1
```
